# Quanta secrets — copy this file to SECRETS next to app.py and fill in values.
# Do NOT commit SECRETS. You may copy SECRETS between trusted machines / standalone installs.
#
# Format: KEY=value  (one per line). Lines starting with # are comments.
#
# --- GitHub API (optional) ---
# Personal access token raises the update-check rate limit (60/h → 5000/h).
# Create at: https://github.com/settings/tokens  (classic: public_repo is enough for public releases)
# GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
#
# Aliases also accepted: QUANTA_GITHUB_TOKEN=...  or  GH_TOKEN=...
#
# Environment variables override this file if set.
